<title>LATVIA: Latvian T-bill yields up, demand down at auction.</title>
<headline>Latvian T-bill yields up, demand down at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Treasury bill yields rose and demand was down at an auction on Wednesday, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD	 LAST  NO OF BANKS    ISSUE  BID  SOLD</p>
<p> One-month    3.32	  3.13	 2	    0.5   0.4   0.4</p>
<p> Three-month  4.08	  3.51	 2	    1.0   0.65  0.65</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
